# Source this file from bash. "parmScanner -help" prints the README.
#
#   parmScanner       generate, and optionally run, a matrix of cases from a base case
#   columnAlign       align the columns of a parameter file for readability
#
# parmScanner sets each case's parameters with setDictEntry, which lives in
# dictator, a separate tool: https://github.com/isoAdvector/dictator
# Source dictator first, or keep it beside or below this repository.
